<title>UK: Kredietbank unit sets 200 mln Dfl perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit sets 200 mln Dfl perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE   PERPETUAL     ISS PRICE  100.23    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    98.98     SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE FROM 2006 AT PAR IF NOT CALLED, RESETS AT</p>
<p>		250 BP OVER PREVAILING 10-YEAR DSL AND EVERY 10</p>
<p>		YEARS THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    75 BP     SELL CONC  1.25 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOV BOND 8.5 PCT JUNE 2006 AND 8.75 PCT JAN 07 DSLS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
